  "label": "Rohingya Refugee Crisis",
  "description": "The Rohingya are a Muslim ethnic minority primarily from Myanmar, who have faced severe persecution, including statelessness, violence, and forced displacement. Understanding their status as refugees is essential to contextualize the image — it is not merely about boys studying, but about a vulnerable, displaced population. The meme uses this context to reinforce negative stereotypes about Muslims by associating them with refugees, which can be used to justify exclusion or hostility.",
